                                "sense_id": "21df54e0-2016-37c2-9fd6-9d1ccb253dea",
                                "text": "A man on one of the beach islands sends his wife and kids to the shelter, remains behind with their dog to finish boarding up the house, then the only road off the island overwashes, and he's cut off."
